//api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-08T20:17:51Z","updated_at":"2026-10-08T20:17:51Z","body":"Looks like another AI generated report. If we can't repro, then there is nothing actionable for us. \n\n@dreamdear1022-boop If you want assistance, then you need to create a bug report that is very clear on what the bug is, and provides sufficient steps for someone else to reproduce the bug. \n\nIts not helpful for us to be told that the LLM told you to comment out a line of code, we need to actually validate the fix manually. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6068277990/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6076927599","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124186#issuecomment-6076927599","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124186","id":6076927599,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABajaObw","user":{"login":"dreamdear1022-boop","id":298947137,"node_id":"U_kgDOEdGSQQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/298947137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop","html_url":"https://github.com/dreamdear1022-boop","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-09T08:00:20Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T01:51:52Z","body":"@clayjohn @stuartcarnie This is a real rendering issue in my project. I used AI to help submit the report. My device is an iPhone 11. My device is an iPhone 11. <p>To clarify: I mean <strong>uncommenting</strong> the line, removing <code>//</code> to enable <code>binding_cache.clear();</code>. Godot 4.6 renders correctly. The issue starts in 4.7 after this call was commented out. Restoring the call renders correctly in my project. The 4.8 dev7 source still has it commented out.</p><table><tr><th>Version</th><th>File / line</th><th>Code</th></tr><tr><td>4.6.1</td><td><a href=\"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4.6.1-stable/drivers/metal/metal_objects.mm#L162\">drivers/metal/metal_objects.mm:162</a></td><td><code>binding_cache.clear();</code></td></tr><tr><td>4.7.1</td><td><a href=\"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a13da4feb8d8aefc283c3763d33a2f170a18d541/drivers/metal/metal3_objects.cpp#L251\">drivers/metal/metal3_objects.cpp:251</a></td><td><code>// \n\nbinding_cache.clear();</code></td></tr><tr><td>4.8 dev7</td><td><a href=\"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/c971f93e7e76b0ef919bf6009e7b868bea04db7f/drivers/metal/metal3_objects.cpp#L419\">drivers/metal/metal3_objects.cpp:419</a></td><td><code>// binding_cache.clear();</code></td></tr></table><p>The function is <code>MDCommandBuffer::bind_pipeline</code>. I am attaching the character project for a more visible example. Open <code>project.godot</code> and press F5 to run <code>face.tscn</code>. Please first try it on iOS / Metal with the unmodified Godot 4.7 engine, then uncomment the call and rebuild the native engine and app to compare the eye whites and highlights. Please investigate this again.</p>","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6076927599/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6077011486","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124186#issuecomment-6077011486","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124186","id":6077011486,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABajfWHg","user":{"login":"Zireael07","id":4525388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjUzODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4525388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07","html_url":"https://github.com/Zireael07","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-09T08:06:27Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T08:06:27Z","body":"Please do not \"use AI to help submit the report\". The template is very simple and filling it out does not require \"AI help\".","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6077011486/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6077052848","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124186#issuecomment-6077052848","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124186","id":6077052848,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABajh3sA","user":{"login":"Zireael07","id":4525388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjUzODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4525388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07","html_url":"https://github.com/Zireael07","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-09T08:09:25Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T08:09:25Z","body":"I see you're a Mandarin speaker - use Baidu, or Google Translate, or DeepL, or some such translation site instead of LLMs","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6077052848/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6077106930","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124186#issuecomment-6077106930","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124186","id":6077106930,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABajlK8g","user":{"login":"dreamdear1022-boop","id":298947137,"node_id":"U_kgDOEdGSQQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/298947137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop","html_url":"https://github.com/dreamdear1022-boop","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-09T08:13:08Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T08:13:08Z","body":"Okay, I'll pay attention to this issue in the future.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6077106930/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6077319526","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124186#issuecomment-6077319526","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124186","id":6077319526,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABajyJZg","user":{"login":"dreamdear1022-boop","id":298947137,"node_id":"U_kgDOEdGSQQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/298947137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop","html_url":"https://github.com/dreamdear1022-boop","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-09T08:28:02Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T08:28:02Z","body":"There was an error in the project file I just submitted, but I have checked and updated it. It includes the actual character model I am using. My implementation involves layering a custom transparent material shader using `next_pass`.  Furthermore, issues arose with both my water shader and the transparency effect for the tree leaves on iOS in version 4.7\n\n<img width=\"2337\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/53545296-3826-4757-87c9-0436e849e716\" />\n\n<img width=\"960\" height=\"572\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a96387f9-a882-4cec-b1ca-ca25862d7d38\" /> \n\nYou can take a look at the contrast between the color of the leaves and the water in the second image.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6077319526/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6078098858","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124186#issuecomment-6078098858","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124186","id":6078098858,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABakhtqg","user":{"login":"dreamdear1022-boop","id":298947137,"node_id":"U_kgDOEdGSQQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/298947137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop","html_url":"https://github.com/dreamdear1022-boop","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dreamdear1022-boop/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-09T09:20:55Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T01:51:33Z","body":"@stuartcarnie @clayjohn \nPlease take a look at my reply and the demo project containing the character model. Let me re-explain the situation: my project behaved consistently across all platforms in version 4.6, but after upgrading to 4.7, this iOS rendering issue appeared. Upon comparing the source code between 4.7 and 4.6, I discovered that the line `binding_cache.clear();` in `drivers/metal/metal3_objects.cpp` had been commented out in 4.7; uncommenting it resolves the issue. I also noticed that this line remains commented out in the 4.8 codebase. I deduced the cause of the problem by analyzing the observed behavior; it appears that the line was commented out to optimize iOS rendering, but doing so introduced this bug.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6078098858/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6089938417","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124186#issuecomment-6089938417","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124186","id":6089938417,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABav0V8Q","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://